ndicator that returns null (if possible). Might cause NullPointerException. Provide test case for plus with other indicator that is a custom Indicator that records calls (spy) to ensure that getValue is called for both delegates. Not needed. Provide test case for plus with other indicator that is a NumericIndicator wrapping a ConstantIndicator(5) but with a different BarSeries (maybe same series). Already constant case. But we can test that plus with other indicator that is a different type (e.g., VolumeIndicator) returns correct sum for each index (volume + constant). Provide test case for plus with other indicator that is a BinaryOperation sum of two indicators (nested). Might be too deep. We'll produce maybe 5-6 new test cases covering these aspects, ensuring no duplication with existing ones. Provide JSON format as required. Use group name "

